From tru64-unix-managers  Tue Jun 26 22:28:30 2001
From: devtty0 () netscape ! net
Date: Tue, 26 Jun 2001 22:28:30 +0000
To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: SUMMARY: SCSI throughput
