To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: AlphaServerSC - cluster problem USEFUL FOR ALL ADMINS!!
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=102653649621921

Hi,
below it's listed a little-great problem that affected my computer...
The solution was:
in TruCluster you need to pay attention to /etc/clua_services file
where cluster members are declared to have an alias name or a
machine name.
So i solved my problem giving out_alias to the domain service of node 1.
I had another problem with clua_services:
i couldn't send mail by nodes 1, 2 and 3 and i solved my problem setting
out_alias
the smtp service.
I hope this info were useful for someone.
Bye, Fedele
