On Wed, 13 Jun 2001 r.rekha@iflexsolutions.com wrote:


Tried chopping the tree from the base?
eg
	cd simsgs/test
	mv I97001/O97002 .
	rmdir I97001
	mv O97002/I97002 .
	rmdir I97002
	etc etc

Scripted something like this:

	#! /bin/sh

	i=1
	
	IDIR=`printf 'I97%03d' $i`
	while [ $i -lt 500 ] 
	do
		ODIR=`printf 'O97%03d' $i`
		mv $IDIR/$ODIR .
		rmdir $IDIR
		i=`expr $i + 1`
		IDIR=`printf 'I97%03d' $i`
		mv $ODIR/$IDIR .
		rmdir $ODIR
	done



