from /dev and then run 'MAKEDEV std' it will create all my pty's and tty's
up to the value of max-users (currently set to 2048).  This is what I want
but I'm not sure if the above command will:

1> only create the first 32-64 pty's/tty's
2> attempt to make other devices as well

I have to have the 2048 pty's for business reasons so any help would be
greatly appreciated.

