Is there any method to "float" a Digital UNIX PAK license (ie fortran or C++ 
licenses) in a similar fashion to Globetrotters FLEXlm whereas a license can
be "checked out" from a license server?

Answer:

To date... no, but there are intentions of implementing the FLEXlm technology. 

Thanks for the replies sent from:
Dr Thomas Blinn
