Hello Managers!

I finally had success with this one, and the award goes to
Nick Hill (N.M.Hill@rl.ac.uk) who reminded me to uncomment 
DTSOURCEPROFILE=true in .dtprofile.  I had uncommented this 
line many times but always put it back to it's original state
when done testing.  I also added per Mahendra.Rajah@URegina.CA
export ENV=$HOME/.kshrc in $HOME/.profile and added set -o emacs
in $HOME/.kshrc.  This combination of commands was all it took!!
Many thanks to all who helped!!  Although it's not a big deal,
I've been driving myself crazy trying to figure it out!


